%% ===========================================================================
\section{Conclusion}
%% ===========================================================================
UnionLabs already let one algorithm run over any physical layer. It now lets one
\emph{experiment} --- nodes, radios, connectors, ports, and the medium of every
hop --- be written down once, checked before it runs, and moved between a
laptop, a lab bench, and a shared testbed without being retyped. Code, images
and the wirings shown here are available at \TODO{repository URL}.

